{"id":1,"name":"Intro Event","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"characterIndex":0,"characterName":"","direction":2,"pattern":0,"tileId":0},"list":[{"code":357,"indent":0,"parameters":["VisuMZ_1_MessageCore","MessageWindowProperties","Message: Properties",{"Rows:num":"4","Width:num":"816","WordWrap:str":"true"}]},{"code":657,"indent":0,"parameters":["Rows = 4"]},{"code":657,"indent":0,"parameters":["Width = 816"]},{"code":657,"indent":0,"parameters":["Word Wrap = true"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Actor1_2",1,0,440,272,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Those who could moved to the nearby refining towns, and the exodus crippled the local tax base. Lacking both money and people, the town was summarily abandoned.  "]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":[" Nowadays the camp was mostly the stomping grounds of high schoolers willing to drive an hour out of their way to get away from their parents."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["College kids came out less frequently, and even then, it was just the freshmen and sophomores who couldn't get into bars yet. "]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["There'd been rumors lately, of monsters in the woods."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Given that the rumors spoke more of carnal urges than carnage, I suspected it was people mishearing about furry fuckfests in the woods."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I hadn't decided if it was fortunate or not that I wouldn't be in a position to take advantage of any bacchanalian activities this weekend."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But I was here with a purpose. My family had moved away when everyone else had, and I hadn't yet learned that my parents love wasn't unconditional. "]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Daddy blamed the 'city' for corrupting his son, but that's like blaming a doctor for your cancer."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["We used to fish up by the lake here, and I'd hoped that one day he'd come around, and we could go again, but he was as dead as the empty town I'd driven through."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The woman I am now has come to mourn. Not the man my father was, per se, but the man I'd hoped he could be."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The relationship we could've had, and those bygone sun-soaked days when he looked at me with love."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["So. I'll fish, work through a six-pack of Rolling Rock, and end the night with a campfire and a good steak."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I finally pull off the road into the parking field of Camp Chrysalis. Rolling the windows down, I take a moment to sit in the sun and the wind and the heady scent of nature."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I jolt awake to the sound of my fishing pole clattering against the bed of the pick-up truck. By the time I get my bearings, the pole's gone, and I hear something running into the woods."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":[" I could never have been the man my father wanted, and I had no reason to die trying."]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":201,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,7,11,10,0,0]},{"code":211,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":3,"walkAnime":true}],"x":0,"y":0}
